00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:11.260
So, the unquestionable highlight of the first
season of Jujutsu Kaisen, my favorite Anime

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:16.040
of the year so far, is the battle between
the special grade curse Hanami and several

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:23.420
of the strongest sorcerer students during
the invasion of Tokyo Jujutsu High.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.750
Not only do we get some of the most stunning
fighting animation I have seen in a while,

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
but the arc is filled with important moments
of character development and growth across

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:33.670
the board.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:38.020
But I think that in the excitement over this
spectacular display of collaboration, effort

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:43.550
and determination by Itadori and co, the secret
hero of this scene's success got ignored by

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:44.620
most fans.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:50.289
Which is a shame, because when you take the
moment to think about it, Hanami is so much

00:00:50.289 --> 00:00:51.920
more than just another curse.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:56.309
I'm gonna go so far and say that you probably
didn't even realize all the symbolism united

00:00:56.309 --> 00:01:01.260
in her character, the message akutami is sending
by having the kids literally fight Mother

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:05.630
Nature and the fact that Hanami is more good
guy than bad guy.

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:10.690
Oh yeah, and let's be honest, her character
design and powers are just the most pleasing

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:13.440
mix of creepy, elegant and badass.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:20.930
This is the character analysis of Hanami,
the spirit of nature.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:21.930
-

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:33.750
Number one, to get it out of the way, I am
gonna call Hanami a her for reasons you'll

