I don't get why this is even a thing, but
people seem to be really obsessed with whether

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:43.330
this armored beast made of cursed energy is
a guy or a girl.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:53.220
It's not like curses generally have offspring
or anything.

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.720
- Well that's awkward.

